{"seq":2,"slug":"chunking-tuning","title":"分块调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/retrieval-chunking-strategies/practice/chunking-tuning","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分块调优\">分块调优</h1><p>有了评测这把尺子，下一个问题是：块大小、重叠、切法、父子窗口——这么多旋钮，按什么顺序拧、每拧一个看哪个指标、什么时候该停手？随手乱调，要么陷入「调了某个数字感觉变好了」的自我欺骗，要么在十几个参数的组合空间里迷路。这一篇把分块调优从碰运气变成有方法的搜索：先调影响最大的旋钮、严格控制变量、用评测而非感觉决定每一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分块调优是一个在评测反馈下的有序搜索过程，核心纪律有三条。一是<strong>按影响排序</strong>：先调对指标影响最大的参数（块大小、切法），再调次要的（重叠、窗口），别一开始就纠结小数点。二是<strong>一次只动一个变量</strong>：固定嵌入、检索器、生成模型、评测集，每次只改一个分块参数，否则指标变化无法归因。三是<strong>用评测拍板</strong>：每一步的取舍都由 <a href=\"chunking-evaluation\">分块评测</a> 的数字决定，不靠「看几个例子感觉变好了」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[固定基线: 递归切分 512/15%] --&gt; B[第一步: 扫块大小]&#10;  B --&gt; C[第二步: 扫重叠]&#10;  C --&gt; D{召回准但答案残缺?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[上父子/窗口检索]&#10;  D --&gt;|否, 召回不准| F[换切法/嵌入]&#10;  E --&gt; G[第三步: 调窗口/父块大小]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{评测增益 &gt; 成本?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[采纳]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[回退到更简方案]\">flowchart TD\n  A[固定基线: 递归切分 512/15%] --&gt; B[第一步: 扫块大小]\n  B --&gt; C[第二步: 扫重叠]\n  C --&gt; D{召回准但答案残缺?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[上父子/窗口检索]\n  D --&gt;|否, 召回不准| F[换切法/嵌入]\n  E --&gt; G[第三步: 调窗口/父块大小]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{评测增益 &gt; 成本?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[采纳]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[回退到更简方案]</pre><p>下表给出旋钮的调节顺序与对应观察指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>顺序</th>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>主要影响</th>\n<th>观察指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>块大小</td>\n<td>召回/精确率/上下文完整性</td>\n<td>Recall@k 曲线 + 答案正确率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>重叠比例</td>\n<td>跨边界召回 vs 重复污染</td>\n<td>Recall 增益 vs 块数膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>切法</td>\n<td>边界质量</td>\n<td>端到端答案质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>父子/窗口</td>\n<td>上下文充足度</td>\n<td>忠实度 + 答案正确率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>元数据/上下文增强</td>\n<td>嵌入精准度</td>\n<td>Precision@k</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从基线开始-先立标杆再优化\">从基线开始：先立标杆再优化</h2><p>调优的第一步永远是建立明确基线，而非直接上花哨方案。可以从「递归字符切分 + 约 512 token + 10–20% 重叠」开始，但要把它标成<strong>实验基线</strong>而非业界结论。NAACL 2025 说明简单固定切分足以成为强对照，2026 复现又说明任务设定会改变赢家（<a href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2025.findings-naacl.114/\">Qu 等，2025</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.16974\">2026 复现</a>）。在 <a href=\"chunking-evaluation\">分块评测</a> 的固定评测集上把检索层与端到端指标全部跑出，作为后续改动的对照。</p>\n<p>没有基线，任何「改进」都是悬空的——你无法说清新方案到底好了多少、值不值这份复杂度。建立基线还有个隐藏好处：很多时候基线已经足够好，评测会直接告诉你「不必再调」，省下大量过度工程。这正是 <a href=\"../methods/fixed-recursive-chunking\">固定与递归分块</a> 强调的「多数项目无需升级」在调优纪律上的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旋钮的调节顺序\">旋钮的调节顺序</h2><p>参数要按影响力从大到小依次调，每调一个固定其余。<strong>第一调块大小</strong>：它是影响最大的旋钮，直接牵动召回、精确率与上下文完整性。在基线附近扫一组值（如 256 / 384 / 512 / 768 / 1024 token），看 Recall@k 曲线与答案正确率——你要找的不是 Recall 最高点，而是「检索指标与答案质量共同的甜区」，因为 <a href=\"../foundations/chunking-impact\">分块对检索的影响</a> 已说明二者可能背离。</p>\n<p><strong>第二调重叠</strong>：在选定的块大小上扫重叠比例（0 / 10% / 15% / 20%）。重叠的判据是「Recall 增益是否盖过块数膨胀」——回忆 <a href=\"../foundations/chunk-size-overlap\">分块粒度与重叠</a> 里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\approx L/(s(1-r))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，重叠每加大都在膨胀索引，若 Recall 几乎不再上升就该停。<strong>第三调切法</strong>：仅当块大小/重叠调到头、评测仍不满意时，才比较递归 vs <a href=\"../methods/structure-aware-chunking\">结构感知</a> vs <a href=\"../methods/semantic-chunking\">语义分块</a>，且必须连成本一起算。<strong>第四步</strong>视瓶颈类型决定：若是「召回准但上下文不足」上 <a href=\"../advanced/parent-child-windows\">父子与窗口检索</a>，若是「嵌入不够精准」上 <a href=\"../advanced/chunk-metadata\">元数据与上下文增强</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时停手-避免过度调优\">何时停手：避免过度调优</h2><p>调优最危险的不是调不动，而是停不下来——在指标已经平台期后继续雕花，把精力耗在噪声内的百分点上，或为了刷某个指标引入脆弱复杂度。停手的判据有三。其一，<strong>指标进入平台期</strong>：连续调整的端到端增益落在置信区间内。其二，<strong>增益盖不过成本</strong>：质量改善不足以抵消索引构建、存储、在线 token 与运维成本。其三，<strong>瓶颈已不在分块</strong>：若召回证据正确、答案仍差，问题更可能在生成或提示，继续调分块是缘木求鱼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用实验清单隔离变量\">用实验清单隔离变量</h2><p>调优结果应由机器可读清单驱动，而不是散落在笔记里的参数。下面的 TypeScript 类型明确哪些变量必须固定、哪些变量允许变化；每次运行都生成唯一配置 ID，指标、时延与成本都绑定到它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Experiment = {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  chunker: &#39;recursive&#39; | &#39;semantic&#39; | &#39;structure&#39; | &#39;proposition&#39;;&#10;  chunkSize: number;&#10;  overlap: number;&#10;  embeddingModel: string;&#10;  retrieverVersion: string;&#10;  generatorModel: string;&#10;  evaluatorVersion: string;&#10;  datasetVersion: string;&#10;};&#10;&#10;function changedFields(a: Experiment, b: Experiment): string[] {&#10;  return (Object.keys(a) as Array&lt;keyof Experiment&gt;).filter((key) =&gt; a[key] !== b[key]);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function assertSingleTreatment(baseline: Experiment, candidate: Experiment) {&#10;  const allowed = new Set([&#39;id&#39;, &#39;chunker&#39;, &#39;chunkSize&#39;, &#39;overlap&#39;]);&#10;  const unexpected = changedFields(baseline, candidate).filter((field) =&gt; !allowed.has(field));&#10;  if (unexpected.length &gt; 0) throw new Error(`confounded experiment: ${unexpected.join(&#39;, &#39;)}`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Experiment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  chunker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'recursive'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'semantic'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'structure'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'proposition'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  chunkSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  overlap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  embeddingModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retrieverVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  generatorModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  evaluatorVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  datasetVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> changedFields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[key]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assertSingleTreatment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">baseline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">candidate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allowed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chunker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chunkSize'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'overlap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unexpected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> changedFields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(baseline, candidate).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">allowed.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(field));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (unexpected.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`confounded experiment: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">unexpected</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">', '</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一批评测查询应对两个候选做配对比较，因为每个查询的难度差异远大于配置间平均差异。报告至少包含每类查询的均值、胜负平数、置信区间、索引耗时、索引大小和平均送入模型的 token。LREC 2026 的 Adaptive Chunking 展示了逐文档选择方法的价值；如果不同文档类型的赢家不同，就应路由策略，而不是强行找一个全局参数（<a href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2026.lrec-1.903/\">Adaptive Chunking</a>）。</p>\n<p>还要警惕<strong>对评测集过拟合</strong>：在同一小评测集上反复调，可能调出只对这批查询好的方案。缓解办法是留出一份调优时不可见的验证集，最终方案只在它上面复测一次。调优产物应是一份「配置 → 指标 → 成本 → 数据版本」的记录，让选择可追溯、可复现，而不是一串拍脑袋的最终值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调优是评测反馈下的有序搜索，三条纪律：按影响排序、一次只动一个变量、用评测而非感觉拍板。</li>\n<li>先建明确的递归基线并跑全指标；<code>512/15%</code> 可作起点，但不是跨语料默认答案。</li>\n<li>旋钮顺序：块大小 → 重叠 → 切法 → 父子/窗口或元数据增强；块大小找「检索与答案共同甜区」，重叠看「增益是否盖过块数膨胀」。</li>\n<li>三种停手信号：指标进入平台期、增益盖不过成本、瓶颈已不在分块；并留验证集防过拟合。</li>\n<li>继续阅读本 hub 的 <a href=\"chunking-evaluation\">分块评测</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/chunk-size-overlap\">分块粒度与重叠</a> 与 <a href=\"chunking-pitfalls\">分块陷阱</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分块调优","id":"分块调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从基线开始：先立标杆再优化","id":"从基线开始-先立标杆再优化"},{"level":2,"text":"旋钮的调节顺序","id":"旋钮的调节顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"何时停手：避免过度调优","id":"何时停手-避免过度调优"},{"level":2,"text":"用实验清单隔离变量","id":"用实验清单隔离变量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分块评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/retrieval-chunking-strategies/practice/chunking-evaluation"},"next":{"title":"分块陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/retrieval-chunking-strategies/practice/chunking-pitfalls"}}